Subject: [PATCH] W1-02: object path tuning report

Runs all three stage comparisons once and logs a Wave-Gate-ready
summary plus the ordered checklist for applying results to real NMS
call sites (BlockPos/MutableBlockPos/Vec3/ChunkPos) once applyPatches
is available.
